---
/**
 * The site's wordmark: `lxrdxe7o` plus a blinking terminal-cursor glyph.
 * Always links home. The cursor is the one recurring signature element of
 * the crimson accent — reused as a focus/active motif elsewhere in the
 * shell rather than treated as one-off decoration.
 */
---
<a href="/" class="brand-mark" aria-label="lxrdxe7o — home">
  <span aria-hidden="true">lxrdxe7o</span>
  <span class="brand-mark__cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</a>
